# Guardio

> Browser security platform protecting 1.5M+ users from phishing, scams, malware, and identity theft. Predicts, detects, and blocks threats before they reach you.

Guardio protects your entire digital world-every account, platform, and device. Lightweight browser extension and mobile app providing real-time threat detection. Scans pages before you open them, filters phishing from emails and SMS, monitors dark web for data breaches. Includes family protection for multiple members. 24/7 human support with <1 hour response time. Available for Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari, iOS, Android.

